pgTAP tests land alongside each PR1 migration (schema, app helpers, RLS masking
matrix, public views) and are run via `pnpm test:db` -> `supabase test db`, which
requires the Supabase CLI and a running local stack (`supabase start`).

Harness wiring (PR0): root `package.json` exposes the `test:db` script; no pgTAP
files exist yet because there is no schema to test against.
